r-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f" :answer-field/choices "19f3bdab-e402-56bf-8271-904a0aa642cb"] [:db/add "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f" :answer-field/choices "64e57532-f196-52c6-85e8-88aa5bf2347e"] [:db/add "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f" :answer-field/choices "c9f97e0c-8d6c-5216-af9c-ee8b465923fe"] [:db/add "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f" :answer-field/choices "041ecb02-4787-5321-ae84-e9e267c8dbc4"] [:db/add "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f" :answer-field/choices "796aa240-9af7-5c80-b27c-5c19fd6b9eaa"] [:db/add "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f" :answer-field/correct "64e57532-f196-52c6-85e8-88aa5bf2347e"] [:db/ensure "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824" :question/id #uuid "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824"] [:db/add "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824" :question/problem "The curve has equation $3 x^{2} + y^{2}=49$. The **tangent** line at $\\left(4,-1\\right)$ meets the $x$-axis at $P$. Find the coordinates of $P$."] [:db/add "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824" :question/worked-solution "Treat $y$ as a function of $x$. Differentiate implicitly and collect the derivative terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n6 x+\\left(2 y\\right)\\frac{dy}{dx}&=0 \\\\\n\\left(2 y\\right)\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\left(6 x\\right) \\\\\n\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\frac{6 x}{2 y}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope at the given point:\n\n$$\nm_{\\mathrm{t}}=-\\frac{24}{-2}=12\n$$\n\nThe tangent line uses $m=12$.\n\nUse the given point and this slope:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-\\left(-1\\right)&=12\\left(x-\\left(4\\right)\\right) \\\\\ny&=12\\left(x-\\left(4\\right)\\right)+\\left(-1\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$. Substitute and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=12\\left(x-\\left(4\\right)\\right)+\\left(-1\\right) \\\\\nx-\\left(4\\right)&=-\\frac{-1}{12} \\\\\nx&=\\frac{49}{12}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore $P=\\left(\\frac{49}{12},0\\right)$."] [:db/add "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824" :question/answer-fields "206dc374-3684-50c1-87cd-9f27c939904f"] [:db/ensure "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054847 :knowledge-point/questions "61250297-8258-5e6f-a79a-e7e33037d824"] [:db/add "13adde5d-86b0-5409-b9bc-410af7b50b77" :answer/id #uuid "13adde5d-86b0-5409-b9bc-410af7b50b77"] [:db/add "13adde5d-86b0-5409-b9bc-410af7b50b77" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "13adde5d-86b0-5409-b9bc-410af7b50b77" :answer/value "\\left(0,-3\\right)"] [:db/ensure "13adde5d-86b0-5409-b9bc-410af7b50b77" :answer/validate] [:db/add "643a3d08-17fb-5442-b0ea-d100d7686525" :answer/id #uuid "643a3d08-17fb-5442-b0ea-d100d7686525"] [:db/add "643a3d08-17fb-5442-b0ea-d100d7686525" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "643a3d08-17fb-5442-b0ea-d100d7686525" :answer/value "\\left(0,- \\frac{13}{4}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "643a3d08-17fb-5442-b0ea-d100d7686525" :answer/validate] [:db/add "908549b3-9799-5bb9-ad25-4b6985780fa6" :answer/id #uuid "908549b3-9799-5bb9-ad25-4b6985780fa6"] [:db/add "908549b3-9799-5bb9-ad25-4b6985780fa6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "908549b3-9799-5bb9-ad25-4b6985780fa6" :answer/value "\\left(0,-10\\right)"] [:db/ensure "908549b3-9799-5bb9-ad25-4b6985780fa6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8dca58c4-e985-5061-9a30-551d7205ab8c" :answer/id #uuid "8dca58c4-e985-5061-9a30-551d7205ab8c"] [:db/add "8dca58c4-e985-5061-9a30-551d7205ab8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8dca58c4-e985-5061-9a30-551d7205ab8c" :answer/value "\\left(0,- \\frac{11}{2}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "8dca58c4-e985-5061-9a30-551d7205ab8c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "204c1878-f15a-52c8-b15c-8cf82e58f862" :answer/id #uuid "204c1878-f15a-52c8-b15c-8cf82e58f862"] [:db/add "204c1878-f15a-52c8-b15c-8cf82e58f862" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "204c1878-f15a-52c8-b15c-8cf82e58f862" :answer/value "\\left(0,\\frac{7}{2}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "204c1878-f15a-52c8-b15c-8cf82e58f862" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/id #uuid "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f"] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/choices "13adde5d-86b0-5409-b9bc-410af7b50b77"] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/choices "643a3d08-17fb-5442-b0ea-d100d7686525"] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/choices "908549b3-9799-5bb9-ad25-4b6985780fa6"] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/choices "8dca58c4-e985-5061-9a30-551d7205ab8c"] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/choices "204c1878-f15a-52c8-b15c-8cf82e58f862"] [:db/add "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/correct "8dca58c4-e985-5061-9a30-551d7205ab8c"] [:db/ensure "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db" :question/id #uuid "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db"] [:db/add "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db" :question/problem "The curve has equation $2 x^{2} + 4 y^{2}=22$. The **tangent** line at $\\left(-3,-1\\right)$ meets the $y$-axis at $P$. Find the coordinates of $P$."] [:db/add "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db" :question/worked-solution "Treat $y$ as a function of $x$. Differentiate implicitly and collect the derivative terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n4 x+\\left(8 y\\right)\\frac{dy}{dx}&=0 \\\\\n\\left(8 y\\right)\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\left(4 x\\right) \\\\\n\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\frac{4 x}{8 y}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope at the given point:\n\n$$\nm_{\\mathrm{t}}=-\\frac{-12}{-8}=- \\frac{3}{2}\n$$\n\nThe tangent line uses $m=- \\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nUse the given point and this slope:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-\\left(-1\\right)&=- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(x-\\left(-3\\right)\\right) \\\\\ny&=- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(x-\\left(-3\\right)\\right)+\\left(-1\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $y$-axis, $x=0$. Substitute and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny&=- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(0-\\left(-3\\right)\\right)+\\left(-1\\right) \\\\\ny&=- \\frac{11}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore $P=\\left(0,- \\frac{11}{2}\\right)$."] [:db/add "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db" :question/answer-fields "0c464e2a-b520-537c-bdb3-2b95009f2a6f"] [:db/ensure "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054847 :knowledge-point/questions "d1475a99-31d5-5d3b-b827-4c42b1dd57db"] [:db/add "64ef6cbb-7907-576b-b4a0-775c19a5627b" :answer/id #uuid "64ef6cbb-7907-576b-b4a0-775c19a5627b"] [:db/add "64ef6cbb-7907-576b-b4a0-775c19a5627b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "64ef6cbb-7907-576b-b4a0-775c19a5627b" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{10}{3},0\\right)"] [:db/ensure "64ef6cbb-7907-576b-b4a0-775c19a5627b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d4ddede2-fcf0-5d1b-8694-8d07d3549a05" :answer/id #uuid "d4ddede2-fcf0-5d1b-8694-8d07d3549a05"] [:db/add "d4ddede2-fcf0-5d1b-8694-8d07d3549a05" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d4ddede2-fcf0-5d1b-8694-8d07d3549a05" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{10}{3},0\\right)"] [:db/ensure "d4ddede2-fcf0-5d1b-8694-8d07d3549a05" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fd253355-197c-54df-be47-2a3ae88b54e2" :answer/id #uuid "fd253355-197c-54df-be47-2a3ae88b54e2"] [:db/add "fd253355-197c-54df-be47-2a3ae88b54e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fd253355-197c-54df-be47-2a3ae88b54e2" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{14}{3},0\\right)"] [:db/ensure "fd253355-197c-54df-be47-2a3ae88b54e2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b965be5a-c6bd-5c86-92ac-a1982abeab2d" :answer/id #uuid "b965be5a-c6bd-5c86-92ac-a1982ab