estion/worked-solution "Treat $y$ as a function of $x$. Differentiate implicitly and collect the derivative terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n6 x+\\left(4 y\\right)\\frac{dy}{dx}&=0 \\\\\n\\left(4 y\\right)\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\left(6 x\\right) \\\\\n\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\frac{6 x}{4 y}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope at the given point:\n\n$$\nm_{\\mathrm{t}}=-\\frac{-12}{-8}=- \\frac{3}{2}\n$$\n\nThe tangent line uses $m=- \\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nUse the given point and this slope:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-\\left(-2\\right)&=- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(x-\\left(-2\\right)\\right) \\\\\ny&=- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(x-\\left(-2\\right)\\right)+\\left(-2\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$. Substitute and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(x-\\left(-2\\right)\\right)+\\left(-2\\right) \\\\\nx-\\left(-2\\right)&=-\\frac{-2}{- \\frac{3}{2}} \\\\\nx&=- \\frac{10}{3}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore $P=\\left(- \\frac{10}{3},0\\right)$."] [:db/add "a4d5312c-4c3b-5396-9fe9-723b2ba4036b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a4d5312c-4c3b-5396-9fe9-723b2ba4036b" :question/answer-fields "f0f3c380-9e07-51a9-afcd-a21f64d3543e"] [:db/ensure "a4d5312c-4c3b-5396-9fe9-723b2ba4036b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054847 :knowledge-point/questions "a4d5312c-4c3b-5396-9fe9-723b2ba4036b"] [:db/add "1e9b38e2-8e31-54e0-8c7e-08d48bdd04fa" :answer/id #uuid "1e9b38e2-8e31-54e0-8c7e-08d48bdd04fa"] [:db/add "1e9b38e2-8e31-54e0-8c7e-08d48bdd04fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1e9b38e2-8e31-54e0-8c7e-08d48bdd04fa" :answer/value "\\left(0,3\\right)"] [:db/ensure "1e9b38e2-8e31-54e0-8c7e-08d48bdd04fa" :answer/validate] [:db/add "869da62c-50f0-5fb5-b267-7885b83decc2" :answer/id #uuid "869da62c-50f0-5fb5-b267-7885b83decc2"] [:db/add "869da62c-50f0-5fb5-b267-7885b83decc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "869da62c-50f0-5fb5-b267-7885b83decc2" :answer/value "\\left(0,7\\right)"] [:db/ensure "869da62c-50f0-5fb5-b267-78